  triage:title "Just lint pytest ReadConcurrencyGateTests fails: fixture WriteOp source lacks PruneDiagnostics/RecordDiagnostics after the AV.3 allowlist was extended" ;
  triage:description "PR #1179 CI (run 33942329987, all 3 OS) fails just lint in .just/tests/test_check_read_concurrency_gates.py test_post_cutover_requires_unignored_liveness_tests with: WriteOp must contain only AV.1b mutation operations; unexpected=[], missing=[PruneDiagnostics, RecordDiagnostics]. AW.2 extended ALLOWED_WRITE_OPS in .just/check_read_concurrency_gates.py (lines 23-33) but did not extend the pytest fixture fake WriteOp enum. Fix: add the two variants to the fixture source at line 115 (and any other fixture that must match the allowlist), rerun python3 -m pytest .just/tests/test_check_read_concurrency_gates.py." ;
